      {
        "id": 202044,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-21T20:49:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Normally, Miss Information is easier with fewer heroes because you need fewer clues in order to flip her.   I have not found this to be the case for challenge Miss Information because of the way she chains Clues.  I beat Ultimate Miss Information using Legacy, Parse, Hunted Naturalist, ChronoRanger, and KNYFE. Let her flip in the first couple of rounds, then burn her out as fast as possible.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:30:40.956Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
